; 24:35 (J) 20:14 (E) 30:43 (P) 32:6 (J; collective) Deut 28:68 ; 1Sam 8:16 ; 2Kin 5:26 ; Isa 14:2 ; Jer 34:9-10 , 11 (twice in verse); 34:16 (twice in verse); Joel 3:2 ; Eccl 2:7 ; 2Chr 28:10 ; Est 7:4 . 2 figurative in address , שִׁפְחָֽתְךָ , etc., of speaker, in token of humility (see אָמָה ) Ruth 2:13 (|| אָמָה 3:9 ), 1Sam 1:18 (|| id. 1:16 ), 25:27 , (|| 25:24 f.), 28:21-22 , 2Sam 14:6-7 , 12 (twice in verse); 14:15 , 17 , 19 ; (|| אָמָה 14:15 ; 14:16 ); 2Kin 4:2 , 16 ; not toward God; but see אָמָה .","rootNote":"feminine from an unused root meaning to spread out (as a family; see 4940 );","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Sam 1 18","keyReferences":["1Sam 1 18","1Sam 8 16","1Sam 25 27","1Sam 25 41","1Sam 28 21","1Sam 28 22","2Chr 28 10","2Kgs 4 2"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":63,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Sam 1 18","book":"1Sam","chapter":1,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שִׁפְחָתְ/ךָ֛","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 8 16","book":"1Sam","chapter":8,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שִׁפְח֨וֹתֵי/כֶ֜ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfpc/Sp2mp"},{"reference":"1Sam 25 27","book":"1Sam","chapter":25,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שִׁפְחָתְ/ךָ֖","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 25 41","book":"1Sam","chapter":25,"verse":41,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/שִׁפְחָ֔ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 28 21","book":"1Sam","chapter":28,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שִׁפְחָֽתְ/ךָ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 28 22","book":"1Sam","chapter":28,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שִׁפְחָתֶ֔/ךָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 28 10","book":"2Chr","chapter":28,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/לִ/שְׁפָח֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncfpa"},{"referen